    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "24. Core Abilities",
    "ruleNumber": "24.02",
    "order": 255,
    "anchor": "24.02",
    "summary": "Copies of one core or weapon ability never stack, even if their numbers or keywords differ. The controlling player picks which copy applies at a time:\n\n- for weapon abilities, again each time the unit attacks, at the Select Weapons step\n- for **[Scouts](vsdata:core-ability/scouts)**, a distance every model in the unit has, otherwise the lowest",
